; DISCARDABLE flag affects segment attributes and relocation dependencies
; Tests: discardable segment offsets, table alignment, flag bit parsing
NAME        DISCARDABLEAPP
EXETYPE     WINDOWS
SUBSYSTEM   WINDOWS
CODE        PRELOAD MOVEABLE DISCARDABLE
DATA        PRELOAD MOVEABLE MULTIPLE DISCARDABLE
HEAPSIZE    1024
STACKSIZE   1024
EXPORTS
    WinMain @1 NONAME
    WndProc @2 NONAME
    InitApp @3 NONAME